Hi Avery,

In case you missed it, here's the short version of what we announced at Vercel Ship last week.

v0 for teams
Generate UI from a prompt, iterate with your designer, and push to a branch. Now with shared projects and your design system loaded.

Fluid compute
Serverless functions that scale like servers: concurrency per instance, no cold starts on the paths that matter, and pricing that drops 30 to 80% for I/O-bound workloads.

AI SDK 5
One API for every model provider, with streaming, tool calls, and structured output. Switch providers with one line.

Also: preview deployments now include a comment thread for stakeholders, and observability gets a query builder.

